      },
      "expect": [
        "EV_FX_UNTRUSTED",
        "EV_STALE"
      ],
      "expect_ok": true,
      "why": "汇率过期既是「不能用」也是「超期」：两条都报，用户才知道为什么换不出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "E18",
      "name": "汇率数量级离谱（USD/CNY = 100000）",
      "items": [
        {
          "kind": "fx",
          "claim": "USD/CNY 100000",
          "value": 100000,
          "base": "USD",
          "quote": "CNY",
          "source_type": "official",
          "url": "https://example.com/fx",
          "observed_at": "2026-10-28"
        }
      ],
      "args": {
        "as_of": "2026-10-29",
        "required_kinds": []
      },
      "expect": [
        "EV_FX_UNTRUSTED"
      ],
      "expect_ok": true,
      "why": "支持币种里最极端的真实交叉汇率离 1e4 还有 5 倍以上余量；100000 只可能是单位写错。旧代码只查正数，它会被直接乘进价格。"
    },
    {
      "id": "E19",
      "name": "币种不在可换算列表里（BTC/CNY）",
      "items": [
        {
          "kind": "fx",
          "claim": "BTC/CNY 2000",
          "value": 2000,
          "base": "BTC",
          "quote": "CNY",
          "source_type": "official",
          "url": "https://example.com/fx",
          "observed_at": "2026-10-28"
        }
      ],
      "args": {
        "as_of": "2026-10-29",
        "required_kinds": []
      },
      "expect": [
        "EV_FX_INVALID",
        "EV_FX_UNTRUSTED"
      ],
      "expect_ok": false,
      "why": "check() 早就报 EV_FX_INVALID，但那只是『报了个错』；fx_rejection 不拒，换算照样发生。现在两处口径一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "E20",
      "name": "两个官方来源互相打架",
      "items": [
        {
          "kind": "price",
          "claim": "899",
          "value": 899,
          "source_type": "official",
          "url": "https://example.com/a",
          "observed_at": "2026-10-28"
        },
        {
          "kind": "price",
          "claim": "1099",
          "value": 1099,
          "source_type": "official",
          "url": "https://example.com/b",
          "observed_at": "2026-10-28"
        }
      ],
      "args": {
        "as_of": "2026-10-29",
        "required_kinds": [
          "price"
        ]
      },
      "expect": [
        "EV_CONFLICT",
        "EV_PRICE_CONFLICT",
        "EV_PRICE_BASIS_UNKNOWN"
      ],
      "expect_ok": true,
      "why": "跨等级差异报 EV_CONFLICT（说明差异即可）；同等级互相打架另报 EV_PRICE_CONFLICT——取平均、取最新、取便宜的都是在替用户挑。 两条都没标口径，所以同时报 EV_PRICE_BASIS_UNKNOWN：无法排除这只是促销/规格/地区差异，而不是数据打架。"
    },
    {
      "id": "E21",
      "name": "官方价与社区价不同：只是警告，不算同级冲突",
